From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:52:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(reasoning): enforce multi-token verify invariance
 for loop containment and thinking budget


Enforce multi-token verify invariance for loop containment and thinking
budget across K=0,5,16,64: guard scheduler copy_draft_alloc updates under
force_thinking_end, scale forced_reasoning_end_grace to max(64, 2*(V+1))
for wide CopyDrafter verification, and align TileLang/Triton thinking
scanners with request.py's 2-state reasoning-parser automaton.

Upstream-base: 19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354
Rationale: Fix 3 loop-containment / thinking-budget edge-case bugs under
           async multi-token speculative verification (#864).
Quality: Exact 2-state reasoning-parser invariance across K=0..64.
Tests: 131/131 repetition, thinking-budget, invariance, and PDL tests
       (PR #1279).
Upstream-status: Local V1 reasoning-budget / loop-containment fix.
